  "version": "0.6.7",
  "notes": "Reply reliability hotfix: generation failures are now persisted in the shared chat database instead of disappearing after live sync; failed replies are visible on both devices and include a Retry button that retries the same saved user message without duplicating it. Successful replies no longer fail because a later automatic-memory extraction step errored. Reply-generation errors are logged for diagnosis, and self-knowledge no longer hard-codes qwen3:8b when another local model is configured.",
